WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.010
- Oh, man. I really got
away with one this time.

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.460
So I was trying to figure
out how to celebrate

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.850
two million subscribers on
this channel, and they say

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.640
that when the student is
ready, the master appears,

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.820
and the timing couldn't have
been better, because I saw

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.410
an article that said Rudy
Giuliani had joined Cameo.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:20.390
Cameo, If you don't know, is
a service where celebrities

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:24.670
of various kinds offer to
record short cell phone videos

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.050
for various reasons and you
send 'em to your friends.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.450
Congratulations, or just
asking them a quick question.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.330
And Rudy Giuliani was a member of Cameo.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.090
For the low, low price of $200,

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.550
you could get him to
say just about anything.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.110
It's only gone up since then.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:42.060
So I filled out the form,
I mentioned my name,

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.010
that I was celebrating
two million subscribers.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.410
I didn't say the channel name,

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.930
but I was really worried because
if he had found my channel,

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.480
he would have seen that
based on the videos

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.930
that our interests are
not exactly aligned,

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.990
in that our judicial philosophies are,

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.610
shall we say, different.

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.620
And I'm sorry to report that
this is exactly what happened.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.790
This video is clickbait.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.640
Rudy Giuliani was onto the ruse.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.430
He respectfully declined
to make a video for me,

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.354
and we went our separate ways.

00:01:07.354 --> 00:01:10.650
(upbeat music)

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:11.700
I'm of course kidding.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.970
Rudy Giuliani did no research whatsoever.

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:16.010
He happily recorded a video the same day

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.100
that I sent in a request,

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.650
and I am thrilled to
present to you the video

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.810
of Rudy Giuliani congratulating me

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.960
on two million subscribers.

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.157
- Hi, Devin. I'm calling
to congratulate you-

00:01:26.157 --> 00:01:28.870
- So, Rudy, this isn't really a call.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.850
You're not calling,
this isn't a voice chat,

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:32.310
this isn't FaceTime.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.410
You're recording this
video and sending it to me.

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:36.240
This isn't a two way street,

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.970
but I guess we'll talk
more about that soon.

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:39.600
But thank you for that congratulations.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.720
- On quite an accomplishment-
- Thank you.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.940
- Having you reach two million subscribers

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:45.660
on your YouTube channel.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:46.820
- Thank you very much.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:50.230
I am so thrilled to have
reached two million subscribers.

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:51.610
I couldn't have done it
without all of the people

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:54.200
that watch Legal Eagle day in and day out,

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.970
and it's an honor to
run the world's largest

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.890
law-related YouTube channel,
one you clearly didn't look up

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:02.420
before you gave me this heartfelt thanks.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:06.550
- That is a, that is a,
really, really quite a thing,

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.980
and something you should be very proud of.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:09.813
- Thank you very much.

00:02:09.813 --> 00:02:11.090
I am, I'm so proud of it.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.030
Thank you. Thank you for those kind words.

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:15.460
- You're an ace attorney
and a Legal Eagle.

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:18.510
- That's so nice of you to
use the name of the channel

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:19.360
that you didn't look up.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.990
I do think that I am an ace attorney,

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.610
and quite a Legal Eagle.

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:25.824
It means nothing coming
from you in particular

00:02:25.824 --> 00:02:28.780
because of the fact that, you know,

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.030
you're not actually licensed
to practice anymore because

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:32.320
of all the nefarious
things you tried to do

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.850
to undermine our democracy.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.082
But I do like to think
of myself as someone

00:02:37.082 --> 00:02:39.670
that's not so much
following in your footsteps,

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:43.240
so much as avoiding your
footsteps altogether.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:46.053
- And I admire really good attorneys.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:55.160
- Who are the attorneys that
Rudy Giuliani looks up to?

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:58.320
I would very much like to know
the answer to that question.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:01.780
I assume that included in
that group is Sidney Powell,

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.840
and frankly, all of us should find someone

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.340
that looks at them the
way that Rudy Giuliani

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.780
looks at Sidney Powell.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.370
And speaking of Sidney
Powell and the whole team

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.890
of kraken wranglers, I
should note that Rudy sent me

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:15.260
this video on the exact same day

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.550
that I put in my request to Cameo.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:20.440
And I think that probably makes
sense, because notoriously,

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.770
Trump hasn't paid him for any of the legal

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:25.120
or quasi-legal services
that Rudy provided.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.600
and I think he probably
needs the money to fight off

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.380
all the lawsuits that
Dominion and Smartmatic

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:31.764
had filed against him and
the entire Sidney Powell

00:03:31.764 --> 00:03:33.610
election fraudster team.

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.590
So I think at this point,
it's probably safe to say

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.290
that I have made more money from Trump

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.920
than Rudy Giuliani has.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.250
I'll let that one sink in for a second.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:45.630
- I would really appreciate
it if you would communicate

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:48.900
with me a contact so that
I can listen to your show,

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.570
and I'd love to talk to you at some point.

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:52.780
- Yeah, so that's gonna be...

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:53.720
that's gonna be really hard,

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.980
because this is a one-way medium.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.950
It's, again, not a call of any kind.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:00.810
I have no way of
contacting you whatsoever.

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:04.180
Additionally, on YouTube,
you don't listen to the shows

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.790
so much as you watch them on
YouTube, because it's video.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:13.060
You watch them in addition
to listening to them.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.200
So I don't think that I'm going
to be reaching out to you,

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.980
except through this particular video,

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.457
but I appreciate the sentiment, thank you.

00:04:20.457 --> 00:04:23.570
- It sounds like they're
very, very impressed with you,

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.100
and I certainly am impressed
with the large number

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.140
of subscribers you were able to achieve.

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:29.861
- Thank you very much.
- So good luck.

00:04:29.861 --> 00:04:31.433
I hope you double it.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.190
Whatever, the sky's the limit, go for it.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.760
It sounds like you're that kind of person.

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.180
- I think I am.

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.850
And probably through the
help of this particular video

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:42.880
that you unwittingly made a cameo in,

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.970
I hope to increase the
number of subscribers

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:48.220
that watch Legal Eagle, the
world's largest law-related

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.820
YouTube channel that you did
not do any research about

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:55.372
before you issued this Cameo
wishing me congratulations.

00:04:55.372 --> 00:04:56.900
So thank you for that.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.860
- And God bless you.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.473
- You know, I'd feel bad.

00:05:01.473 --> 00:05:04.100
He seems like such a nice guy.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:07.370
I'd feel bad if it weren't
for all of the attempts

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.350
to destroy America's democracy.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.610
I'm sure Eichmann was a real nice guy

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:13.450
in conversation as well,
except for, you know,

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.150
all the unpleasantness in the 40s.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:18.143
I almost feel bad about
tricking Rudy Giuliani into

00:05:18.143 --> 00:05:21.350
wishing me a congratulations
on two million subscribers.

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:22.228
- God bless you.

00:05:22.228 --> 00:05:25.940
Thanks. Now, as funny
as this whole thing is,

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.850
I'd be remiss if I didn't
turn it into a learning

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.840
opportunity, because I think
there's a lot of things

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:31.850
that we can all learn
from Rudy's debasement

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.050
in this whole affair.

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:34.670
The first is that your
reputation is everything.

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:37.250
Once that's gone, it's never coming back.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.080
The other is that you
should choose your clients

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.340
very carefully, because
if they don't pay you

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.860
and are notorious for
skipping out on the bill,

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.440
then you might need money
by doing crazy things

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:51.000
like going on Cameo for the
cash, especially when you're not

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.490
able to actually practice as a lawyer.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.780
Because one of the main
differences between Rudy and myself

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.090
is I'm actually still licensed to practice

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:00.533
in the state of New York.

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:04.990
And perhaps the most
important lesson of all

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:09.210
is that if a YouTuber asks you
to provide some video footage

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:12.220
to them and pays you $200
to say some nice things

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:16.060
about them, perhaps you should
do a modicum of research

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:20.083
to actually, you know, find
out who that YouTuber is.

00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:22.962
So kids, don't be like Rudy Giuliani,

00:06:22.962 --> 00:06:25.253
or I'll see you in court.

